{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"THE door to shipped memory bytes (one-memory-cycle A1+B2) - the deliberate act that turns instance learnings into an authored, reviewable manual diff; run it while preparing a branch commit. Two feeds: (1) the instance-local overlay (runtime/agent/memory-overlay/<lib>.<ctl>.jsonl - every deposit and curation delta accumulated against this library's shipped manuals) is FOLDED into the facets and the folded files deleted; (2) the brain's unpromoted subject claims (kb entries whose subject names this library; bare-library subjects file onto the eponymous control) are union-merged on exact-claim identity and the brain copies stamped promoted (journaled kb patch). Facets are (re)written as line-oriented JSON: an array with one canonical object per line, comma-terminated, closed by a constant claim-less terminator line - valid single-document JSON for the store loader, conflict-free under .gitattributes *.memory merge=union. Returns {promoted, already_present, folded, failures}.","import":"use ndata::dataobject::DataObject;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse ndata::data::Data;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::command::Command;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;","params":[{"name":"lib","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"ovppsz1a001b4abacu1","readers":[],"time":1787320395806,"username":"system","writers":[]}